# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ZAFIEON PHARMA — environment
#
# Copy to `.env.local` for development. Set the same values in the deployment's
# environment for production. Never commit a filled-in copy.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Admin Dashboard ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Both are required before /admin will accept a login. Generate them with:
#
#     node tools/admin-hash.mjs "your chosen password"
#
# ADMIN_SESSION_SECRET signs the session cookie. 32+ characters.
# Changing it signs every open session out.
ADMIN_SESSION_SECRET=

# scrypt hash of the admin password, "scrypt:<saltHex>:<keyHex>".
ADMIN_PASSWORD_HASH=

# Plaintext alternative, for local development only. ADMIN_PASSWORD_HASH wins
# where both are set, and the login screen warns while this one is in use.
# ADMIN_PASSWORD=

# ── Insights image storage ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Where the four replaceable Insights images are kept.
#
# Default driver: the filesystem, at the path below. It must be persistent
# storage — a mounted volume, not an ephemeral container filesystem — or
# uploads are lost on the next deploy. Deliberately outside `public/`.
# INSIGHT_STORAGE_DIR=.data/insights

# Set this to store uploads in Vercel Blob instead. Required on any serverless
# host, where the filesystem does not persist between invocations.
# BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN=
